{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f\u00a0 A Cozy Adventure With The King Of France In The Louvre\u2019s Attic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the curious ghost <strong>Louis Charles</strong>, King of France, fluttering through the Louvre\u2019s attic after hours. Paint with pixie dust. Dispel dusty bunnies. Lead the musketeers into frosting food fights for prizes and cute outfits. Open doors to extend the attic. On one balcony or another, there\u2019s a bonbon full of diamonds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f <strong>Paintings</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s the Louvre. Of course there are paintings! Collect pixie dust and get to work. Finishing a painting makes your musketeers stronger. Finishing them all unlocks new floors. Sometimes the doors are locked, however, and you\u2019ll need to paint a masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc57 <strong>Costumes </strong>\u2013 The armoires are guarded by a terrible tyrant. Defeat the tyrant and get a piece of fancy clothes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Dusty Bunnies </strong>\u2013 Swirl enough dusty bunnies around and they might finish a painting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd87 <strong>Attic Bats</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s true that you\u2019re a ghost and you float, but wings help you float faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Explorations </strong>\u2013 The Louvre\u2019s astral attic is big, spooky, and three dimensional. Every trip is different!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680920?t=1751841921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680920?t=1751841921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680920/3892ecaebf18a73b48508082b77a6135d70d2822/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751841921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680920/3892ecaebf18a73b48508082b77a6135d70d2822/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751841921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f\u00a0 A Cozy Adventure With The King Of France In The Louvre\u2019s Attic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the curious ghost <strong>Louis Charles</strong>, King of France, fluttering through the Louvre\u2019s attic after hours. Paint with pixie dust. Dispel dusty bunnies. Lead the musketeers into frosting food fights for prizes and cute outfits. Open doors to extend the attic. On one balcony or another, there\u2019s a bonbon full of diamonds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f <strong>Paintings</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s the Louvre. Of course there are paintings! Collect pixie dust and get to work. Finishing a painting makes your musketeers stronger. Finishing them all unlocks new floors. Sometimes the doors are locked, however, and you\u2019ll need to paint a masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc57 <strong>Costumes </strong>\u2013 The armoires are guarded by a terrible tyrant. Defeat the tyrant and get a piece of fancy clothes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Dusty Bunnies </strong>\u2013 Swirl enough dusty bunnies around and they might finish a painting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd87 <strong>Attic Bats</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s true that you\u2019re a ghost and you float, but wings help you float faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Explorations </strong>\u2013 The Louvre\u2019s astral attic is big, spooky, and three dimensional. Every trip is different!</p>","developers":["Matthew Melmon